<title>HUNGARY: Fotex plans convertible bond issue.</title>
<headline>Fotex plans convertible bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian retailer Fotex Rt called an extraordinary general meeting for November 12 to ask approval from its shareholders for a private convertible bond issue and a linked conditional capital rise.</p>
<p>Fotex plans to issue the bonds in four tranches, it said in the official bourse gazette. Conditions of the placement is to be discussed at the general meeting, it said.</p>
<p>On the Budapest Stock Exchange Fotex closed at 105 forints, up two.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
